{"4438480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PAVLOV23", "steam_appid": 4438480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The experiment is complete. Personnel evacuated. No survivors. Or almost none…<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438480/extras/0aab2bc70856a4b5655cec7b8e2b14f2.poster.avif?t=1785400290\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438480/extras/0aab2bc70856a4b5655cec7b8e2b14f2.webm?t=1785400290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438480/extras/0aab2bc70856a4b5655cec7b8e2b14f2.mp4?t=1785400290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>  <br><strong>You regain consciousness in a laboratory of a sealed scientific complex. Lights flicker. Somewhere in the darkness — movement. No communication. No visible exit.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to Project <strong>“PAVLOV23.”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a Soviet research institute where every laboratory is a key and every document is a fragment of a terrifying truth. The corridors grow tighter, the anomalies more real, and the line between experiment and experimenter thinner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight what remains of the personnel.<br>Save every bullet.<br>Do not trust what you see.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438480/extras/38e0ea6001ce7d93547ce1c20a0f8a4c.poster.avif?t=1785400290\" width=654 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438480/extras/38e0ea6001ce7d93547ce1c20a0f8a4c.webm?t=1785400290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438480/extras/38e0ea6001ce7d93547ce1c20a0f8a4c.mp4?t=1785400290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Combat system inspired by classic 90s FPS — fast, brutal, hardcore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survival horror with resource management — every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Environmental storytelling — notes, documents, immersive surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Soviet Noir visual style — high-contrast graphics with a distinctive look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Soundtrack: dark ambient + metal — the tension builds from the first second to the last breath.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Alternate USSR — Soviet science, hints of occultism, psychological horror.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438480/extras/f7cfdb59c8cb8ea81d6a848839470b99.poster.avif?t=1785400290\" width=578 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438480/extras/f7cfdb59c8cb8ea81d6a848839470b99.webm?t=1785400290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438480/extras/f7cfdb59c8cb8ea81d6a848839470b99.mp4?t=1785400290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>What happened that day — you will discover. The question is whether you’ll want to know.</strong> </h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The experiment is complete. Personnel evacuated. No survivors. Or almost none…<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438480/ex